  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "09. Movement Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "09.07",
    "summary": "An Engaged unit can Fall Back under the Moving rules, up to M. Choose Ordered or Desperate Escape. A Battle-shocked unit must choose Desperate Escape. For Desperate Escape, make a Hazard roll for each model before moving. Models can pass through enemies, and the unit takes a Battle-shock roll afterwards unless it is already Battle-shocked. Either option must end Unengaged and prevents shooting or charging for the rest of the turn.",
